{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aRoboSoul: Chariot\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro Pixel-Style Co-op Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25c6 Story</strong><br>Little robots Blue and Red embark on a journey aboard their &quot;Chariot&quot; to the legendary Power Source, hoping to save their town from energy crisis. As a prequel to \u300aRoboSoul\u300b, this adventure reveals the origins of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25c6 Core Gameplay</strong><br>\u25b8 <strong>Dynamic Duo Control</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pilot a single chariot together, seamlessly switching between 1 driver seat and 4 gunner positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seats transform into different functional modes based on each player's character (Blue/Red)<br>\u25b8 <strong>Cooperation &amp; Chaos</strong>:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physics-based mayhem might accidentally eject your teammate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Requires perfect coordination for movement, attacks and energy management</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25c6 Enemies &amp; Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle against the mechanical &quot;Resistron Army&quot; that stands in your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your chariot's capabilities through adventure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25c6 Key Features</strong><br>\u2022 Classic top-down pixel art style<br>\u2022 Deep integration between character traits and chariot modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;The real challenge isn't the enemies - it's not getting yeeted by your teammate!&quot;</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590090?t=1745892053","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590090?t=1745892053","capsule_image":"https://share